WEBVTT

01:30.270 --> 01:34.920
[The Heir]

01:35.490 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 10]

01:50.680 --> 01:51.560
Master Qi.

01:53.400 --> 01:54.310
Master Qi.

01:58.000 --> 01:59.039
Master Tian.

01:59.870 --> 02:01.330
Eldest Young Master Tian.

02:01.350 --> 02:02.350
Nice to meet you.

02:02.350 --> 02:03.150
Nice to meet you.

02:03.150 --> 02:03.840
Please have a seat.

02:03.840 --> 02:04.500
Have a seat.

02:04.710 --> 02:05.350
Have a seat.

02:05.350 --> 02:05.950
Please.

02:09.630 --> 02:10.310
Master Qi,

02:10.840 --> 02:12.870
you are new to Huizhou,

02:13.150 --> 02:15.470
and Yihousheng has just opened.

02:15.750 --> 02:17.840
I should have brought my son

02:18.190 --> 02:19.079
and gifts

02:19.400 --> 02:20.600
to congratulate you.

02:20.630 --> 02:21.490
I didn't expect

02:21.520 --> 02:23.000
you to visit us first.

02:23.030 --> 02:24.870
I'm terribly sorry.

02:25.280 --> 02:27.190
Master Tian, please don't be so polite.

02:27.190 --> 02:27.590
Please sit.

02:27.590 --> 02:28.400
Please sit.

02:33.470 --> 02:35.130
Young Master Tian, are you...

02:35.150 --> 02:38.750
already studying how to recreate
the ancient lacquer-soot ink?

02:39.000 --> 02:40.240
Lord Yan is hosting a banquet,

02:40.240 --> 02:41.630
giving ink merchants in Huizhou

02:41.630 --> 02:43.030
a chance to show their abilities.

02:43.030 --> 02:45.240
How could the Tian family
dare to neglect this?

02:45.240 --> 02:46.910
It's just that
recreating ancient ink is not easy.

02:46.910 --> 02:48.510
We are still figuring it out.

02:49.400 --> 02:50.190
No wonder

02:50.680 --> 02:52.520
all the raw lacquer in Huizhou

02:52.750 --> 02:55.000
has been bought up by you.

02:55.240 --> 02:58.630
We know our foundation in ink-making
is weak

02:58.750 --> 03:00.310
and we can't compare with others,

03:00.310 --> 03:01.190
so

03:01.430 --> 03:03.160
we prepared more raw materials

03:03.280 --> 03:06.120
and plan to experiment with every method
of recreating the ink.

03:06.120 --> 03:08.150
When it comes to business,

03:08.150 --> 03:09.960
I still have a lot to learn
from you, Master Tian.

03:09.960 --> 03:10.520
You flatter me.

03:10.520 --> 03:11.850
You have great courage.

03:11.870 --> 03:14.270
What a brilliant move
to strike at the root.

03:14.360 --> 03:17.020
It's just that it has blocked
many people's path

03:17.190 --> 03:19.450
and taken many opportunities
from them.

03:20.630 --> 03:22.470
I heard that other ink merchants

03:22.630 --> 03:25.030
are still struggling with the raw lacquer.

03:25.560 --> 03:26.420
You flatter me.

03:27.750 --> 03:29.120
But I heard

03:29.120 --> 03:31.920
there will be a new batch of raw lacquer
in Huizhou.

03:32.280 --> 03:33.480
When that time comes,

03:33.520 --> 03:36.079
will you buy it all up again, Master Tian?

03:36.710 --> 03:37.960
By then,

03:37.960 --> 03:40.120
if you have any financial difficulties,

03:40.120 --> 03:41.190
you can come to me.

03:41.630 --> 03:44.630
I am willing to lend you a hand.

03:45.960 --> 03:47.190
Thank you, Master Qi.

03:48.430 --> 03:50.079
Come on, have some tea.

03:50.240 --> 03:50.750
Sit.

03:55.710 --> 03:56.470
As expected.

03:57.360 --> 03:59.090
Visiting the Tian family today

03:59.120 --> 04:01.470
and seeing your grand mansion,

04:02.360 --> 04:03.080
it's clear

04:03.520 --> 04:06.450
that it is indeed
the top ink maker family in Huizhou.

04:06.630 --> 04:07.310
Xiao Qi,

04:07.710 --> 04:09.630
you reported false information.

04:09.870 --> 04:12.520
Just from the ancient books and ink recipes
that Eldest Young Master Tian reads,

04:12.520 --> 04:15.650
one can see that the Tian family
has a profound heritage.

04:15.730 --> 04:16.820
Why did you tell me

04:16.850 --> 04:19.600
that only the Chen and Li families
have a century-old heritage,

04:19.600 --> 04:21.800
while the Tian family is just servants?

04:24.120 --> 04:25.870
Apologize to Master Tian.

04:28.830 --> 04:29.760
No need, no need.

04:30.240 --> 04:32.040
Master Qi, you flatter us.

04:32.240 --> 04:33.560
Speaking of heritage,

04:34.120 --> 04:37.190
how can we compare
with the Li and Chen families?

04:37.800 --> 04:39.920
Master Tian, please don't be modest.

04:41.240 --> 04:42.560
I'm new here,

04:42.560 --> 04:45.070
but I also want to be part
of the Huizhou ink industry.

04:45.070 --> 04:46.930
So I'd like to know how each family

04:47.390 --> 04:48.600
made their fortune,

04:48.870 --> 04:50.159
and which school

04:50.360 --> 04:52.070
your ink-making method comes from.

04:52.070 --> 04:54.480
Master Tian, why don't you tell me?

04:58.870 --> 05:01.360
Tian Ink only started to improve

05:01.560 --> 05:03.160
when it came into my hands.

05:03.920 --> 05:06.680
So there's no rich heritage

05:06.950 --> 05:08.270
or school to speak of.

05:08.390 --> 05:10.680
Then I need to learn from you even more.

05:10.720 --> 05:11.870
I truly admire

05:12.270 --> 05:15.120
how you built the Tian family fortune

05:16.190 --> 05:19.000
from scratch to what it is today.

05:21.310 --> 05:23.040
Master Qi, I heard that, although young,

05:23.040 --> 05:24.710
you're already General Qi's trusted aide.

05:24.710 --> 05:27.680
You came to Huizhou to procure
military supplies for General Qi.

05:27.680 --> 05:30.190
You must be no ordinary person.

05:44.000 --> 05:46.860
Procuring military supplies
is a military secret.

05:48.040 --> 05:49.680
Very few people

05:49.870 --> 05:50.870
know my identity.

05:51.830 --> 05:53.070
That you found out

05:53.070 --> 05:55.070
my identity so quickly...

05:55.270 --> 05:56.240
I've always heard that

05:56.240 --> 05:58.560
the Tian family is very resourceful

05:58.600 --> 06:00.530
and well-established in Huizhou.

06:00.680 --> 06:01.740
Just as I expected.

06:01.920 --> 06:03.510
During my stay in Huizhou,

06:03.560 --> 06:05.870
I will have to rely on you, Master Tian

06:06.800 --> 06:08.460
and Eldest Young Master Tian.

06:10.360 --> 06:11.310
Alright, alright.

06:11.310 --> 06:13.240
Let's not talk about this anymore.

06:13.480 --> 06:14.630
May I ask, Master Qi,

06:14.630 --> 06:17.230
did you bring your family
to Huizhou this time?

06:17.510 --> 06:19.750
Should I have my men

06:19.920 --> 06:21.830
prepare some gifts
and send them to your residence

06:21.830 --> 06:23.800
as a gesture of hospitality?

06:27.310 --> 06:28.240
I...

06:29.560 --> 06:31.510
thank you on behalf of...

06:32.750 --> 06:34.390
my family in heaven.

06:39.310 --> 06:40.360
Years ago,

06:41.390 --> 06:42.600
some villains

06:43.510 --> 06:46.000
caused my family's death.

06:47.720 --> 06:49.680
Now, I am the only one left.

06:50.680 --> 06:52.680
I'm sorry for misspeaking.

06:53.270 --> 06:55.430
Please don't take offense, Master Qi.

06:56.800 --> 06:59.950
I believe
that good and evil will get their due.

07:00.360 --> 07:02.920
Your family's grievances
will be redressed,

07:03.120 --> 07:04.980
and their deaths will be avenged.

07:06.560 --> 07:09.040
Thank you for your kind words,
Master Tian.

07:12.360 --> 07:14.360
Master, Lord Zhao is here.

07:15.240 --> 07:16.120
Lord Zhao?

07:19.390 --> 07:20.240
Is this Lord Zhao

07:20.240 --> 07:22.720
the Lord Zhao Shen from the county office?

07:23.240 --> 07:25.920
It seems you and Lord Zhao are very close.

07:26.000 --> 07:28.800
No wonder you know my identity so well.

07:29.950 --> 07:31.390
Doing business—

07:31.430 --> 07:34.800
since ancient times, it has never been
fully separable from political power.

07:34.800 --> 07:35.830
Master Qi,

07:36.040 --> 07:39.040
didn't you also establish connections
with Lord Yan?

07:39.390 --> 07:40.450
I stand corrected.

07:40.790 --> 07:42.870
Since you have an important guest today,

07:42.870 --> 07:44.750
I won't bother you anymore.

07:44.950 --> 07:46.010
I'll take my leave.

07:46.680 --> 07:49.430
Please forgive our poor reception today.

07:49.720 --> 07:52.270
I hope you can understand, Master Qi.

07:53.040 --> 07:54.040
Next time,

07:54.159 --> 07:55.490
I will prepare some wine

07:55.560 --> 07:57.720
and invite you to visit and catch up.

07:58.560 --> 07:59.890
Thank you, Master Tian.

08:00.000 --> 08:00.600
This way.

08:05.070 --> 08:05.830
Master Qi,

08:06.360 --> 08:08.000
please take care of us from now on.

08:08.000 --> 08:08.920
Thank you.

08:10.120 --> 08:10.950
Lord Zhao.

08:11.600 --> 08:13.360
Excuse me for not going out to meet you.

08:13.360 --> 08:14.240
Come, please.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.120
No need for formalities.

08:15.120 --> 08:15.430
Lord Zhao.

08:15.430 --> 08:16.230
Come on.

08:16.430 --> 08:17.270
Please.

08:18.510 --> 08:19.750
Please.

08:18.590 --> 08:20.970
[Zhao Shen,
County Magistrate of Shexian, Huizhou]

08:21.190 --> 08:21.870
Come on.

08:21.870 --> 08:22.480
Lord Zhao.

08:22.480 --> 08:24.070
Please.

08:25.750 --> 08:26.600
Master Qi,

08:26.720 --> 08:27.630
see you.

08:40.480 --> 08:41.200
Xiao Qi.

08:41.960 --> 08:42.630
Master.

08:44.030 --> 08:47.090
It seems these two
are still colluding with each other.

08:48.840 --> 08:50.100
This is actually good.

08:54.390 --> 08:55.360
Zhao Shen.

08:59.150 --> 09:00.000
Zhao Shen...

09:04.030 --> 09:04.960
Mother.

09:05.480 --> 09:06.240
Mother.

09:06.480 --> 09:07.320
You're back?

09:10.870 --> 09:11.480
What?

09:12.630 --> 09:13.790
Why did you two

09:14.120 --> 09:15.840
come back empty-handed?

09:16.040 --> 09:17.790
All the raw lacquer available outside

09:17.790 --> 09:18.870
has sold out.

09:19.270 --> 09:21.000
Well... if we can't buy raw lacquer,

09:21.000 --> 09:22.260
how can we make the ink?

09:23.120 --> 09:25.200
Anyone who makes
this ancient lacquer-soot ink

09:25.200 --> 09:27.550
will gain the favor
of the Ink Affairs Official.

09:27.550 --> 09:29.460
I'm afraid all the ink workshops
in Huizhou

09:29.460 --> 09:31.650
are working hard for this.

09:32.110 --> 09:34.910
The supply of raw lacquer
is naturally very tight.

09:36.480 --> 09:37.320
However...

09:38.390 --> 09:41.030
I always feel that something is off.

09:45.270 --> 09:46.030
Zhen.

09:46.960 --> 09:48.490
Your Seventh Grandmother.

10:05.790 --> 10:07.000
Zhen,

10:07.390 --> 10:09.030
at the banquet last night,

10:09.030 --> 10:11.750
you stood up for me.

10:12.140 --> 10:15.970
I haven't properly thanked you yet.

10:16.600 --> 10:17.550
Seventh Grandmother,

10:17.550 --> 10:19.010
You don't need to thank me.

10:19.080 --> 10:20.080
I did it

10:21.080 --> 10:22.740
also for Grandfather's sake.

10:25.120 --> 10:27.380
In any case, on behalf of the main family,

10:27.510 --> 10:29.360
you took on this task.

10:29.960 --> 10:33.000
The main family is indebted to you.

10:35.600 --> 10:36.510
Zhen,

10:37.080 --> 10:38.270
we all know

10:38.960 --> 10:42.550
that making the ancient lacquer-soot ink
is different from lampblack-making.

10:42.550 --> 10:47.000
The waste lacquer and materials
from trial formulations

10:47.360 --> 10:51.320
place extremely strict demands
on the smoke shed.

10:52.670 --> 10:54.750
That old ink workshop

10:55.840 --> 10:57.360
is in disrepair.

10:57.510 --> 10:58.510
Why don't you

10:59.440 --> 11:03.170
go back to the main family to develop
the ancient lacquer-soot ink?

11:07.440 --> 11:11.200
The workers and masters there
will be at your disposal.

11:11.510 --> 11:13.910
The main family will bear all the losses.

11:14.320 --> 11:15.240
This way,

11:16.070 --> 11:18.750
you can develop it without distraction.

11:20.840 --> 11:21.840
What do you think?

11:28.000 --> 11:29.240
Seventh Grandmother.

11:29.240 --> 11:31.150
Regarding the recreation
of the ancient lacquer-soot ink,

11:31.150 --> 11:33.870
I have a few things to discuss with you.

11:35.360 --> 11:36.220
I'm listening.

11:38.600 --> 11:39.360
First,

11:39.750 --> 11:41.390
I'm only returning to Li's Ink Workshop,

11:41.390 --> 11:42.520
not the main family.

11:42.790 --> 11:44.080
As for the internal affairs
of the Li family,

11:44.080 --> 11:45.680
I don't want to get involved.

11:51.150 --> 11:52.200
Oh, Zhen.

11:54.390 --> 11:56.000
I know in my heart

11:56.790 --> 11:59.450
that you still have issues
with the main family.

11:59.550 --> 12:01.360
I will never force you.

12:03.440 --> 12:04.240
Second.

12:05.000 --> 12:05.910
If Li Jing...

12:11.960 --> 12:13.270
If Uncle Jingdong

12:14.200 --> 12:15.870
and Fourth Aunt Jiangyue

12:15.960 --> 12:17.360
cause trouble in my face,

12:17.750 --> 12:19.390
I definitely won't take it lying down.

12:19.390 --> 12:20.240
If that happens,

12:20.240 --> 12:22.440
don't let it delay our real business.

12:23.320 --> 12:25.510
You can rest assured on that.

12:25.840 --> 12:28.480
As for your Uncle Jingdong
and Fourth Aunt,

12:28.790 --> 12:30.520
I will take care of everything.

12:31.790 --> 12:32.670
Third,

12:33.080 --> 12:35.010
I took on this task for Grandfather

12:35.320 --> 12:36.510
and the Li family.

12:37.200 --> 12:40.270
If the ancient lacquer-soot ink
is developed successfully,

12:40.270 --> 12:42.510
the main family can have the ink recipe,

12:42.790 --> 12:45.920
but the Eighth Branch
also needs to share in the profits.

12:46.030 --> 12:46.960
As for how much,

12:47.200 --> 12:49.510
you can decide, Seventh Grandmother.

12:51.750 --> 12:53.320
That's reasonable.

12:54.000 --> 12:56.550
I can certainly agree to that.

12:58.600 --> 13:00.260
Thank you for understanding.

13:12.670 --> 13:14.080
Oh, my Zhen.

13:17.000 --> 13:18.910
You have really grown up.

13:23.200 --> 13:25.150
Look at you now.

13:27.200 --> 13:31.150
You are steady and thoughtful.

13:32.470 --> 13:34.670
You even know how to fight for yourself.

13:36.910 --> 13:40.840
I am very pleased.

13:44.480 --> 13:45.670
Well,

13:46.150 --> 13:48.870
I naturally learned all of this from you.

13:49.150 --> 13:50.670
From me?

13:52.480 --> 13:53.480
Zhen.

13:54.320 --> 13:56.200
During the development process,

13:57.120 --> 13:58.840
if you encounter any difficulties,

13:58.840 --> 14:00.720
tell me directly.

14:02.390 --> 14:03.480
Seventh Grandmother,

14:03.480 --> 14:05.610
there is actually one thing right now.

14:06.440 --> 14:08.840
Today my brother and I
went to buy raw lacquer,

14:08.840 --> 14:11.080
but it's sold out in the market.

14:11.080 --> 14:12.270
It's fine.

14:13.030 --> 14:14.870
Your Sixth Grandfather

14:15.000 --> 14:16.670
has a manor in the suburbs.

14:16.790 --> 14:18.990
He planted a new field of lacquer trees,

14:19.200 --> 14:20.600
enough for your use.

14:21.320 --> 14:23.180
However, your Sixth Grandfather

14:23.740 --> 14:25.790
wants you to ask for it in person.

14:28.480 --> 14:29.750
Seventh Grandmother,

14:30.320 --> 14:31.600
can't you

14:32.030 --> 14:33.600
go all the way to help?

14:34.600 --> 14:36.670
Haven't I done enough?

14:36.910 --> 14:38.910
You've asked for so much

14:38.910 --> 14:40.750
from me.

14:41.870 --> 14:44.720
Can't I bargain with you?

14:45.790 --> 14:46.910
I understand.

14:47.120 --> 14:49.650
Then I will go find Sixth Grandfather
myself.

14:52.030 --> 14:53.080
Seventh Grandmother,

14:53.080 --> 14:55.870
if the ancient lacquer-soot ink
is developed successfully,

14:55.870 --> 14:56.960
when I get the money,

14:56.960 --> 14:59.630
I will treat you to tea.

15:00.620 --> 15:02.310
You little clever one.

15:03.870 --> 15:06.200
Okay. I'll wait.

15:08.670 --> 15:10.080
To Sixth Grandfather's?

15:10.560 --> 15:13.200
Oh, Zhen, you want me to act
as a persuader.

15:23.440 --> 15:24.570
Sixth Grandfather.

15:30.030 --> 15:31.160
Sixth Grandfather.

15:40.750 --> 15:41.880
Sixth Grandfather.

15:44.310 --> 15:45.440
Sixth Grandfather.

15:45.670 --> 15:47.730
Zhen and I are here to get raw lacquer.

15:47.900 --> 15:49.150
Please write a note

15:49.180 --> 15:50.840
so we can go find Aunt Chunhua.

15:57.080 --> 15:58.240
You think

15:59.320 --> 16:02.360
you really can recreate this ancient ink?

16:07.020 --> 16:09.910
"You only discover the difficulty
through practice.

16:09.910 --> 16:12.510
Without earnest practice,
you can't truly understand it."

16:12.510 --> 16:14.240
If I don't even try,

16:14.270 --> 16:16.870
how will I know if I can recreate it?

16:56.670 --> 16:57.750
This ink

16:58.790 --> 17:01.480
and the lacquer-soot ink you saw
at Lord Yan's banquet

17:01.480 --> 17:03.870
are both ancient ink.

17:05.680 --> 17:06.720
Its background

17:07.510 --> 17:08.589
and origin

17:09.200 --> 17:10.530
are no less impressive.

17:11.000 --> 17:12.750
If you can figure out

17:13.200 --> 17:14.589
the trick behind this,

17:15.349 --> 17:17.160
I can give you the raw lacquer.

17:18.270 --> 17:19.550
If you can't,

17:20.270 --> 17:21.550
the deal is off.

17:39.640 --> 17:40.770
Sixth Grandfather,

17:40.880 --> 17:43.240
this inscription is already blurred.

17:43.480 --> 17:44.610
How can I examine it?

17:45.000 --> 17:46.730
If the inscription were clear,

17:47.200 --> 17:48.510
why would I test you?

17:48.510 --> 17:51.310
Sixth Grandfather,
Seventh Grandmother said...

17:51.440 --> 17:52.240
She said...

18:02.640 --> 18:05.720
Although this ink has a thick patina,

18:06.160 --> 18:08.960
it still can't hide
its wonderful ink iridescence

18:09.030 --> 18:10.240
and lasting charm.

18:11.790 --> 18:14.640
Based on the fish-scale pattern on it,

18:15.880 --> 18:18.750
this ink must be quite old.

18:22.240 --> 18:24.240
It's full of a medicinal fragrance,

18:24.240 --> 18:27.550
mixed with a faint scent.

18:30.510 --> 18:32.110
If I'm not mistaken,

18:32.110 --> 18:35.270
the key lies in this faint scent.

18:40.480 --> 18:41.590
It's lotus!

18:48.880 --> 18:49.920
I know.

18:50.350 --> 18:51.400
This ancient ink

18:51.400 --> 18:53.350
is the world-famous Longxiang.

19:06.350 --> 19:07.510
Do you know

19:08.960 --> 19:10.000
its origin?

19:13.640 --> 19:16.160
When I was young, I heard my father say

19:16.350 --> 19:19.720
that Emperor Ming of Tang
was once the Governor of Luzhou.

19:20.070 --> 19:22.030
One night, while writing at his desk,

19:22.030 --> 19:23.510
he saw a little Taoist priest in black

19:23.510 --> 19:25.160
jump out of the inkstone on the table,

19:25.160 --> 19:26.400
walking like a fly.

19:26.590 --> 19:29.030
Seeing him, he called out,
"Long live the Emperor."

19:29.030 --> 19:31.640
Emperor Ming of Tang
asked the little Taoist his origin.

19:31.640 --> 19:32.970
The little Taoist said,

19:34.110 --> 19:36.680
"I am the spirit of ink, Longbin."

19:37.400 --> 19:39.590
After Emperor Ming of Tang ascended
the throne and began producing ink,

19:39.590 --> 19:41.440
he thought of Longbin,

19:41.590 --> 19:44.720
so he named this ink Longxiang.

19:46.110 --> 19:47.200
Sixth Grandfather,

19:47.200 --> 19:48.030
am I...

19:48.590 --> 19:49.310
right?

19:53.310 --> 19:55.790
The key to this ink is...

19:56.920 --> 19:58.750
Mixing it with lotus juice.

20:18.720 --> 20:20.110
Take this note

20:20.880 --> 20:23.880
to the manor in the western suburbs,
find Aunt Chunhua,

20:23.880 --> 20:25.210
and get the raw lacquer.

20:28.880 --> 20:30.160
Thank you, Sixth Grandfather.

20:30.160 --> 20:32.310
Then I won't disturb you anymore.

20:35.350 --> 20:36.110
Here you go.

20:38.550 --> 20:39.510
We got it!

20:46.880 --> 20:47.510
Hua'er,

20:47.830 --> 20:49.400
thank you so much for today.

20:49.400 --> 20:51.200
You took the time to come with me.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.000
What's the big deal?

20:52.000 --> 20:53.570
It's so fun to go on a spring outing.

20:53.570 --> 20:54.180
Besides,

20:54.210 --> 20:56.440
I haven't seen Aunt Chunhua
for a long time.

20:56.440 --> 20:59.160
I heard Sixth Grandfather has been busy
with the ink workshop,

20:59.160 --> 21:01.420
so she's been alone in the suburban manor

21:01.480 --> 21:03.440
and hasn't been to town for a long time.

21:03.440 --> 21:04.160
As far as I remember,

21:04.160 --> 21:06.350
Aunt Chunhua has a very gentle temper.

21:06.600 --> 21:07.680
She can actually

21:07.710 --> 21:09.790
manage such a big manor all by herself.

21:09.790 --> 21:11.350
Has Uncle been helping her?

21:12.590 --> 21:15.110
Originally, Aunt Chunhua was all alone,

21:15.310 --> 21:16.440
taking care of Run

21:16.440 --> 21:17.880
and managing some maids

21:17.880 --> 21:19.160
and farmhands.

21:19.440 --> 21:21.720
It just so happens
that Uncle has recently returned,

21:21.720 --> 21:22.920
so he can help her out.

21:24.160 --> 21:25.310
My father said

21:25.590 --> 21:27.750
that Sixth Grandfather

21:28.200 --> 21:29.590
is very wary of him.

21:29.960 --> 21:31.750
Just to keep him from managing the manor,

21:31.750 --> 21:33.750
he sent him to Suzhou on business.

21:35.640 --> 21:37.000
Sixth Grandfather's suspicion—

21:37.000 --> 21:38.270
he guards against others
as if they were wolves.

21:38.270 --> 21:39.400
Exactly.

21:40.750 --> 21:41.880
We're almost there.

21:41.880 --> 21:42.480
Let's go.

21:45.750 --> 21:47.920
Watch out. It might run into you later.

21:47.920 --> 21:48.750
Let's run.

21:51.720 --> 21:54.210
[Li Chunhua, daughter
of the Sixth Branch of the Li family]

21:58.440 --> 22:00.410
[Li Decai, son-in-law of the Sixth Branch
of the Li family. Original name Wang Decai]

22:00.550 --> 22:01.350
Zhen.

22:02.070 --> 22:04.920
The top-grade raw lacquer was just tapped
by the farmhand yesterday.

22:04.920 --> 22:06.350
You guys rest first.

22:06.440 --> 22:07.640
I'll go get it myself.

22:08.400 --> 22:09.030
Chunhua.

22:09.510 --> 22:11.200
Lacquer trees bite.

22:12.160 --> 22:13.480
Just rest here

22:13.720 --> 22:15.510
and drink tea with the girls.

22:15.590 --> 22:16.750
I'll go fetch it.

22:17.240 --> 22:18.240
Thank you, Uncle.

22:20.620 --> 22:21.820
[Three liters of raw lacquer]

22:26.110 --> 22:27.270
Come on, sit first.

22:28.400 --> 22:29.440
Have some tea.

22:34.030 --> 22:34.920
Chunhua!

22:35.440 --> 22:37.370
I brought the lacquer bucket back!

22:41.200 --> 22:42.790
Come on, Zhen, look.

22:43.160 --> 22:44.030
Look.

22:44.200 --> 22:46.160
A full three liters of raw lacquer.

22:46.160 --> 22:47.150
Thank you, Uncle.

22:47.150 --> 22:49.020
Don't. This bucket is too dirty.

22:49.160 --> 22:50.310
Don't dirty your hands.

22:50.310 --> 22:52.270
It's fine. I often do work at home.

22:52.270 --> 22:53.870
A bit of dirt doesn't matter.

22:54.590 --> 22:55.750
I'll have a farmhand

22:55.830 --> 22:57.790
send it back for you.

22:58.750 --> 23:00.790
Well then, thank you, Uncle.

23:01.510 --> 23:02.400
Father!

23:06.780 --> 23:07.260
This...

23:07.960 --> 23:09.390
[Li Zhengrun, grandson
of the Sixth Branch
of the Li family, Li Chunhua's son]

23:18.350 --> 23:19.680
You brat!

23:20.880 --> 23:21.680
This raw lacquer is poisonous!

23:21.680 --> 23:23.410
Do you want to kill your father?

23:25.310 --> 23:27.070
And you have the nerve to cry?

23:27.110 --> 23:28.240
Don't scold him now.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.530
Go change your clothes.

23:31.240 --> 23:32.030
Go!

23:33.200 --> 23:34.110
This...

23:36.200 --> 23:38.400
Zhen, I'm really sorry.

23:38.480 --> 23:39.880
The child is still young
and doesn't know any better.

23:39.880 --> 23:42.610
I'll have the farmhand
get some more raw lacquer.

23:48.590 --> 23:49.590
Are you alright?

23:50.160 --> 23:50.920
Does it hurt?

23:52.750 --> 23:54.110
Don't cry.

23:55.400 --> 23:56.600
Let me blow it for you.

24:01.960 --> 24:02.790
Li Decai.

24:04.830 --> 24:06.590
What did you put in the raw lacquer?

24:06.590 --> 24:07.830
Why is it so watery?

24:15.200 --> 24:16.070
Chunhua,

24:16.400 --> 24:17.400
it's all my fault.

24:18.030 --> 24:19.630
Please forgive me this time.

24:19.920 --> 24:20.920
It's all my fault.

24:20.960 --> 24:23.880
I-I was foolish. I was foolish.

24:24.720 --> 24:26.160
Tell the truth.

24:27.160 --> 24:28.400
I was just thinking

24:28.830 --> 24:31.030
that the price of raw lacquer
was at its peak,

24:31.030 --> 24:33.400
and Tian Benchang was offering generously,

24:33.400 --> 24:35.920
so I promised the Tian family five liters.

24:36.750 --> 24:38.150
But who would've thought

24:38.350 --> 24:40.240
Father would give

24:40.240 --> 24:42.110
the raw lacquer we worked so hard for

24:42.110 --> 24:45.400
to Miss Li Zhen?

24:46.030 --> 24:47.920
Then it wouldn't be enough.

24:48.790 --> 24:50.320
What are you talking about?

24:50.750 --> 24:52.880
Seventh Aunt personally agreed to let Zhen

24:52.880 --> 24:55.000
make lacquer-soot ink in our house.

24:55.110 --> 24:56.480
You know that.

25:00.590 --> 25:01.590
Chunhua,

25:03.720 --> 25:05.000
I am useless!

25:16.510 --> 25:17.350
Zhen,

25:17.790 --> 25:18.680
sorry to keep you waiting.

25:18.680 --> 25:19.440
Aunt.

25:22.610 --> 25:24.480
Why are you alone? Where is Hua'er?

25:24.480 --> 25:25.750
Run wouldn't stop crying,

25:25.750 --> 25:27.410
so Hua'er took him out to play.

25:28.440 --> 25:29.920
I'm really sorry today

25:30.070 --> 25:31.530
for holding you up so long.

25:33.680 --> 25:34.400
Aunt,

25:34.790 --> 25:35.720
these years...

25:36.400 --> 25:37.800
have you been doing well?

25:39.580 --> 25:40.340
Not bad.

25:42.590 --> 25:43.120
Uncle...

25:43.920 --> 25:45.110
This bucket

25:45.130 --> 25:46.480
is actually quite heavy.

25:46.480 --> 25:48.400
Be careful when you take it back.

25:48.750 --> 25:50.110
I'll be going then, Aunt.

25:50.110 --> 25:50.920
I won't bother you anymore.

25:50.920 --> 25:52.550
I'll go find Hua'er and Run.

25:52.550 --> 25:53.160
Okay.

25:58.400 --> 25:59.110
Aunt,

25:59.960 --> 26:01.960
if anything happens in the future,

26:02.550 --> 26:03.680
remember to call me.

26:03.880 --> 26:05.010
I'll always be here.

26:19.470 --> 26:22.480
[Li Ink]

26:20.680 --> 26:22.400
I wonder what Old Madam was thinking,

26:22.400 --> 26:24.330
making a little girl an ink-maker.

26:24.350 --> 26:25.610
Who will submit to her?

26:25.750 --> 26:27.280
Who will follow her orders?

26:27.350 --> 26:28.640
Isn't this nonsense?

26:28.680 --> 26:29.480
Manager Shao,

26:29.550 --> 26:31.310
business at the ink workshop
has been bad these years,

26:31.310 --> 26:32.510
and people are already divided.

26:32.510 --> 26:33.550
If Miss Li Zhen

26:33.550 --> 26:34.880
comes here and messes things up,

26:34.880 --> 26:36.240
it will be even harder to manage.

26:36.240 --> 26:38.440
What are your plans?

26:39.030 --> 26:40.350
Calm down.

26:40.670 --> 26:42.480
I know you're in a difficult position.

26:42.480 --> 26:43.480
Let's just consider it

26:43.480 --> 26:45.510
as temporarily lending her
the ink workshop.

26:45.510 --> 26:47.240
We're still the ones in charge.

26:47.640 --> 26:48.960
If she wants materials or staff,

26:48.960 --> 26:50.070
she has to go through me.

26:50.070 --> 26:51.240
The rules of this ink workshop

26:51.240 --> 26:52.240
haven't changed.

27:07.090 --> 27:09.060
[Li Ink]

27:12.160 --> 27:13.400
Father, look.

27:13.400 --> 27:15.130
First, I scrape off the ink ash.

27:15.160 --> 27:17.000
Then, after scraping,

27:17.000 --> 27:20.680
I add shell scent, frankincense,
plum blossoms, and osmanthus.

27:20.740 --> 27:22.160
After that, I knead it into a paste

27:22.160 --> 27:24.240
and pound it with a heavy hammer.

27:24.510 --> 27:27.000
I strike it hard.

27:27.070 --> 27:28.400
And after that?

27:28.400 --> 27:31.030
Then I turn it over and keep pounding it.

27:34.510 --> 27:37.170
Left for men, right for women.
What should we do?

27:37.640 --> 27:38.310
Right.

27:40.440 --> 27:41.240
Good.

28:09.720 --> 28:10.640
Manager Shao.

28:11.810 --> 28:13.620
[Shao An, Manager of Li Ink]

28:12.720 --> 28:13.480
Miss Li Zhen.

28:20.920 --> 28:22.480
This is the ink workshop.

28:31.200 --> 28:33.000
This is the ink mixing workshop.

28:42.440 --> 28:44.440
This is Mr. Zhao, who sifts the soot.

28:44.580 --> 28:45.750
-Mr. Zhao.
-What great abilities

28:45.750 --> 28:47.160
can a woman have?

28:52.790 --> 28:53.640
Manager Shao.

28:54.310 --> 28:55.200
From now on,

28:55.590 --> 28:58.200
Miss Li Zhen will be coming and going
in the smoke shed often,

28:58.200 --> 28:59.920
so you need to dress properly.

29:00.000 --> 29:01.550
Working in the ink workshop,

29:01.550 --> 29:03.350
we've always dressed like this.

29:03.480 --> 29:04.590
Yeah, exactly.

29:04.590 --> 29:06.640
If anyone gets sick from the heat,

29:06.680 --> 29:08.030
and the schedule is delayed,

29:08.030 --> 29:09.270
who will take responsibility?

29:09.270 --> 29:11.830
Besides, in the Li's Ink Workshop,

29:11.880 --> 29:15.070
everyone has always been treated equally,
regardless of status.

29:15.070 --> 29:16.350
You can't just

29:16.590 --> 29:17.830
change everything

29:18.240 --> 29:19.640
just because a woman is here.

29:19.640 --> 29:21.590
Yeah, exactly.

29:22.830 --> 29:24.290
I was wondering who it was.

29:24.330 --> 29:25.240
Turns out it's that fool
from the other day

29:25.240 --> 29:27.200
who couldn't recognize
my supreme-grade lampblack.

29:27.200 --> 29:29.030
Anyway, I'm not the one being embarrassing
right now,

29:29.030 --> 29:30.350
so why should I care?

29:33.720 --> 29:35.110
What a sassy temper.

29:37.750 --> 29:39.270
No wonder 3 years ago,

29:39.350 --> 29:42.030
you dared to break off the engagement
in front of everyone.

29:42.030 --> 29:43.440
I guess since then,

29:43.750 --> 29:46.610
you haven't cared
about reputation and propriety.

29:48.790 --> 29:50.920
You are the ones half-naked right now.

29:51.070 --> 29:53.200
Speaking of reputation and propriety,

29:53.200 --> 29:54.930
you are the ones who don't care.

29:57.790 --> 29:59.590
Hurry up and put on your clothes.

30:02.200 --> 30:03.330
Put on your clothes.

30:25.310 --> 30:26.070
Miss Li Zhen,

30:26.240 --> 30:27.650
this is Li Ink's smoke shed.

30:27.650 --> 30:28.680
You can use it.

30:28.880 --> 30:29.920
Well, Manager Shao,

30:29.920 --> 30:32.200
I need 30 soot bowls,

30:32.590 --> 30:33.920
10 bundles of lamp wick,

30:34.000 --> 30:35.460
and 30 ink-mixing basins.

30:35.480 --> 30:36.510
And as for the raw lacquer

30:36.510 --> 30:38.480
I got from Sixth Grandfather yesterday,

30:38.480 --> 30:41.740
please have it properly packaged
and sent to my smoke shed.

30:41.920 --> 30:43.200
If you want them,

30:43.440 --> 30:46.070
you must first get a note and then
get them from the warehouse.

30:46.070 --> 30:47.510
You'll need to get the note with me;

30:47.510 --> 30:49.640
the warehouse is managed by Mr. Jiang.

30:49.920 --> 30:51.270
Once you have the items,

30:51.400 --> 30:52.820
you need to keep track of how much is used

30:52.820 --> 30:54.510
and how much is left yourself.

30:54.920 --> 30:56.790
Make a tally after work every day.

30:57.310 --> 30:58.510
When this is over,

30:58.550 --> 31:00.400
I need to inspect and verify.

31:00.920 --> 31:01.850
So troublesome?

31:02.200 --> 31:03.640
This is the rule of Li Ink.

31:05.270 --> 31:06.070
Understood.

31:10.310 --> 31:12.960
How much raw lacquer to use first
and how much later—

31:12.960 --> 31:14.350
there is no fixed amount.

31:14.350 --> 31:15.240
Rewrite it.

31:23.110 --> 31:24.030
Manager Shao,

31:24.440 --> 31:25.500
please take a look.

31:29.400 --> 31:32.720
The type and quantity of the soot bowls
are not clearly specified.

31:32.720 --> 31:33.680
Rewrite it.

31:40.200 --> 31:42.160
What kind of soot bowl do you want,
Miss Li Zhen?

31:42.160 --> 31:43.550
Number one is the largest.

31:43.550 --> 31:44.680
We also have number 3

31:44.680 --> 31:45.960
and the smallest size.

31:51.720 --> 31:53.790
Manager Shao, here.

31:55.590 --> 31:57.920
There's absolutely no problem this time.

33:09.880 --> 33:10.920
I'm back.

33:11.310 --> 33:12.370
Zhen, you're back?

33:12.480 --> 33:12.830
Come on.

33:12.830 --> 33:13.960
Grandfather, time to eat.

33:13.960 --> 33:14.720
Zhen is back.

33:14.720 --> 33:15.720
Time to eat, Zhen.

33:16.830 --> 33:17.590
Sit.

33:25.350 --> 33:26.200
Eat more.

33:26.310 --> 33:27.910
You've been working all day.

33:28.680 --> 33:29.550
Zhen.

33:30.000 --> 33:32.640
You usually look so happy
while making lampblack.

33:32.640 --> 33:35.970
Why do you look so down
while making this lacquer lampblack?

33:36.030 --> 33:37.200
In the past, the lampblack-making formula

33:37.200 --> 33:38.600
was pretty much the same.

33:38.640 --> 33:40.790
I just needed to focus on
timing and heat control.

33:40.790 --> 33:41.830
But now,

33:42.160 --> 33:44.480
I have to try
every combination of soot and oil.

33:44.480 --> 33:45.200
It's really completely different

33:45.200 --> 33:46.440
from what I imagined.

33:48.070 --> 33:49.200
That raw lacquer—

33:49.200 --> 33:50.460
if you're not careful—

33:50.640 --> 33:52.040
may cause lacquer sores.

33:53.350 --> 33:54.310
This ointment

33:54.590 --> 33:55.680
can heal it.

33:56.550 --> 33:58.070
Wh-What lacquer sores?

33:58.270 --> 33:59.030
What sores?

33:59.590 --> 34:00.390
It's nothing.

34:03.680 --> 34:04.510
Come, let me see.

34:04.510 --> 34:05.270
Let me see your hands.

34:05.270 --> 34:06.200
It's fine.

34:07.440 --> 34:08.360
Mother, it's fine.

34:08.360 --> 34:10.760
Oh my, why is it so severe?

34:10.760 --> 34:11.440
This one.

34:11.820 --> 34:12.710
Let me see this one.

34:12.710 --> 34:13.510
I'm fine.

34:13.510 --> 34:14.480
Does it hurt?

34:14.550 --> 34:15.280
No.

34:15.280 --> 34:16.070
Give me the medicine.

34:16.070 --> 34:16.710
Hurry.

34:20.150 --> 34:21.440
Look at you.

34:21.840 --> 34:23.400
It's all about making money.

34:23.400 --> 34:25.760
Since the ancient lacquer-soot ink
is so hard to make,

34:25.760 --> 34:27.510
why get involved in this and put yourself

34:27.510 --> 34:29.770
through all this unnecessary hardship?

34:30.880 --> 34:32.280
I don't mind a little hardship.

34:32.280 --> 34:33.920
What bothers me
is that some people and things

34:33.920 --> 34:34.880
really annoy me.

34:35.230 --> 34:36.800
Especially Manager Shao.

34:36.920 --> 34:38.389
Ever since I joined the ink workshop,

34:38.389 --> 34:39.550
he's been picking on me every day.

34:39.550 --> 34:41.440
He either says I didn't log my materials,

34:41.440 --> 34:43.440
or that the quantities don't add up.

34:43.880 --> 34:44.960
Just to get some soot bowls,

34:44.960 --> 34:47.360
he made me run back and forth
several times.

34:47.510 --> 34:48.400
This guy.

34:48.550 --> 34:49.920
He has really gone too far.

34:49.920 --> 34:51.400
Shao An's behavior

34:51.760 --> 34:53.150
is the same as before.

34:54.030 --> 34:55.030
In that case,

34:55.440 --> 34:56.510
I'm relieved.

34:57.800 --> 35:00.150
Grandfather, what do you mean by that?

35:04.550 --> 35:05.960
Tell me,

35:06.440 --> 35:07.770
according to your plan,

35:08.150 --> 35:10.480
how long will the lampblack-making take?

35:11.070 --> 35:13.070
I probably won't finish testing

35:13.070 --> 35:15.150
all the combinations one by one
until next month.

35:15.150 --> 35:16.280
Next month?

35:16.480 --> 35:17.920
That's another month!

35:18.400 --> 35:19.710
That's already fast.

35:19.880 --> 35:21.320
I made a rough estimate.

35:21.360 --> 35:23.560
There are still over 200 combinations.

35:25.710 --> 35:27.920
That will take forever!

35:28.920 --> 35:29.800
Come on, that one.

35:29.800 --> 35:31.440
Even if it takes forever,

35:31.510 --> 35:32.510
I have to do it.

35:32.550 --> 35:34.030
Isn't that how Father and Grandfather

35:34.030 --> 35:35.510
did it back then?

35:38.760 --> 35:39.710
True.

35:40.920 --> 35:42.320
Back in the day, your father

35:42.320 --> 35:44.380
would burn over twenty lamps at once.

35:49.920 --> 35:50.760
Yeah.

35:51.320 --> 35:52.920
The combinations are different,

35:52.920 --> 35:54.780
but it's still making lampblack.

35:55.030 --> 35:56.760
If I burn several lamps together,

35:56.760 --> 35:58.420
it will definitely be faster.

35:59.110 --> 35:59.960
Mother,

36:00.440 --> 36:02.150
I can really count on you.

36:02.150 --> 36:02.670
What's happening?

36:02.670 --> 36:03.840
Grandfather, I'm done eating.

36:03.840 --> 36:06.040
I'm going to the smoke shed to try again.

36:06.400 --> 36:07.480
You haven't finished your food.

36:07.480 --> 36:08.110
Finish it before you go.

36:08.110 --> 36:08.970
You barely ate.

36:09.190 --> 36:10.030
Come on.

36:12.320 --> 36:13.000
Bye.

37:23.000 --> 37:23.800
Grandfather!

37:24.280 --> 37:25.080
Grandfather!

37:25.150 --> 37:26.070
Take a look.

37:26.320 --> 37:28.840
How does the lacquer lampblack
I recreated look?

37:28.840 --> 37:29.550
Here.

37:43.030 --> 37:45.800
This lacquer lampblack feels dull.

37:48.960 --> 37:51.960
In terms of quality, it's only passable.

37:53.280 --> 37:56.280
If used for making ink,
it would only be mediocre.

37:58.360 --> 38:00.190
This is the best lampblack

38:00.190 --> 38:01.850
out of over 200 combinations.

38:03.150 --> 38:03.880
How about

38:04.360 --> 38:06.880
I divide the raw materials more finely?

38:07.150 --> 38:08.230
I don't believe

38:08.230 --> 38:09.510
that even if I adjust it drop by drop,

38:09.510 --> 38:11.770
I still can't find the best combination.

38:12.230 --> 38:13.000
Zhen.

38:17.800 --> 38:18.600
Grandfather.

38:22.280 --> 38:23.480
Why do I feel

38:25.130 --> 38:28.080
it's because the raw lacquer

38:28.840 --> 38:30.710
and tung oil didn't mix completely?

38:30.710 --> 38:32.960
Grandfather, I followed your instructions.

38:32.960 --> 38:35.230
After preparing each raw material,

38:35.230 --> 38:37.480
I stirred it slowly with a bamboo pestle

38:37.480 --> 38:39.140
to prevent foam from forming.

38:43.000 --> 38:44.120
Here's what you'll do.

38:44.120 --> 38:46.250
Go get some soybean oil, sesame oil,

38:46.480 --> 38:48.440
animal fat, and tea seed oil.

38:51.110 --> 38:53.320
Prepare as many types as possible,

38:54.070 --> 38:55.470
but in small quantities.

38:55.960 --> 38:57.760
If we find a mixture

38:57.800 --> 38:58.630
among these oils,

38:58.630 --> 39:01.150
maybe it will allow the raw lacquer
and tung oil

39:01.150 --> 39:02.280
to blend completely.

39:02.280 --> 39:04.000
This is a rough method
for making lampblack.

39:04.000 --> 39:05.190
I see, Grandfather.

39:13.880 --> 39:14.710
Animal fat?

39:16.480 --> 39:18.670
I feel like I've seen a formula

39:19.440 --> 39:22.240
for making lampblack using animal fat
somewhere.

39:22.660 --> 39:24.590
Making lampblack with animal fat?

39:24.760 --> 39:26.110
I must have seen it.

39:40.440 --> 39:41.590
Miscellaneous uses...

39:41.590 --> 39:43.590
When animal fat is burned, it yields

39:44.280 --> 39:46.140
extremely fine, deep black soot,

39:46.760 --> 39:48.190
known as lacquer soot.

39:53.070 --> 39:53.960
Animal fat?

39:54.760 --> 39:56.190
It really is animal fat.

40:00.020 --> 40:02.090
[Ink Chronicles]

41:08.280 --> 41:10.070
Manager Shao, Manager Sun.

41:11.320 --> 41:12.920
I was just about to look for you.

41:12.920 --> 41:14.050
Come and take a look.

41:14.960 --> 41:17.150
I suddenly came up with
2 methods yesterday,

41:17.150 --> 41:18.800
so I came to the smoke shed
to try them out.

41:18.800 --> 41:21.190
Can this lampblack be used now?

41:40.840 --> 41:42.440
Although it has a rich sheen,

41:42.670 --> 41:44.150
it's too oily.

41:44.230 --> 41:46.400
The ink paste is hard to mold,

41:46.400 --> 41:48.060
leaving it loose and fragile.

41:49.480 --> 41:51.810
It seems
I still haven't got the hang of it.

41:52.670 --> 41:54.840
It's fine. I'll just try again.

41:55.110 --> 41:56.840
I won't bother you two anymore.

42:16.840 --> 42:17.710
Master Qi,

42:18.320 --> 42:19.480
please wait a moment.

42:19.480 --> 42:21.480
I will go and announce your arrival.

42:29.630 --> 42:31.630
These are the simplest ink recipes.

42:31.960 --> 42:33.890
They are very easy to distinguish.

42:35.670 --> 42:37.070
Why are you here?

42:37.630 --> 42:38.670
Seventh Grandmother,

42:38.670 --> 42:40.880
this is a new friend I made today.

42:41.400 --> 42:42.920
He is not a street urchin.

42:42.920 --> 42:44.280
His name is Luo Wenqian.

42:45.360 --> 42:47.840
Luo Wenqian, this fish lantern is for you.

42:50.000 --> 42:50.630
Thank you.
